  summary="On a cold wartime Saturday Katherine endures her bullying superior, Mr. Anstey, and takes a colleague suffering from toothache to a dentist and then home, a small act that draws her into the lives of strangers. The middle part returns to her adolescent visit to the Fennels' comfortable house, where her romantic hopes of Robin were disappointed in a summer of boating, tennis and misunderstanding. In the final part, back in the snowbound present, Robin, now a soldier, unexpectedly seeks her out; they spend the night together without love, and she accepts that neither the past nor romance can rescue her from her solitude.",
